# The hermetic suite: the test files that run with no database, no network and no pod.
#
# One pattern per line, because the list is appended to constantly and a single-line list
# makes every append collide. Two branches that each add a test used to conflict in
# package.json every time, on a line neither of them had read; on separate lines git merges
# them without asking. Order is the run order. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# This list is opt-in on purpose. Most of tests/ is NOT here: a suite that needs mongo, a
# pod or the network belongs to test:crystal or to no scripted suite at all. Do not invert
# it into glob-everything-minus-exclusions — the majority of what is left out lives under
# tests/unit/crystal, so the inverted form would be a longer list that fails open, pulling
# every new non-hermetic crystal suite into the hermetic run the day it is written.

tests/unit/allocutio/**/*.test.ts
tests/unit/web/**/*.test.ts
tests/unit/architecture/**/*.test.ts
